      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "a_sch_office03_eve04",
      "hash64": "8F5DA9DBF978582A",
      "text": "如果寶可夢受傷了，\\n去醫務室就能接受治療喔。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "a_sch_office03_eve07",
      "hash64": "8F5DA8DBF9785677",
      "text": "要是在班上遇到了不開心的事情，\\n我就會在這裡休息。\\c\\n……米莫莎老師不會過問任何事情，\\n真的很溫柔。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 25,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "a_sch_office03_ni01",
      "hash64": "5CB3DF5C0B29144A",
      "text": "學生們都用「米磨砂」\\n這個綽號來叫米莫莎老師！\\r\\n……我跟她本人說了之後，被她瞪了一眼！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 23,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "a_sch_office03_ni02",
      "hash64": "5CB3DE5C0B291297",
      "text": "N/A",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
